se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nAt a movie theater ticket window, ticket seller Xiao Chen is selling movie tickets. He tells the audience Xiao Liu, \"Today there are 8 movies showing, most are comedies, some are animations, but there are hardly any horror movies.\" Xiao Liu looks at the movie schedule and finds that there are only 3 horror movies.\n\n[Question]\nPlease ask how many comedies Xiao Liu guesses before looking at the movie schedule?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before looking at the movie schedule, Xiao Liu guesses there are 6 comedies.\nB. Before looking at the movie schedule, Xiao Liu guesses there are 7 comedies.\nC. Before looking at the movie schedule, Xiao Liu guesses there are 5 comedies.\nD. Before looking at the movie schedule, Xiao Liu guesses there are 4 comedies.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001926681396359216,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e26dd6006945d28026ec","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368109205,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:35:09","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c42584d771d64df28ea297a7956dff9e"}